Description
This suite provides basic netfilter function test through xtables and/or nftables
- Rules add/flush in different table/chain.
- policy test.
- basic target/action test.
- basic NAT target.

Dependencies
nmap-ncat lksctp-tools conntrack-tools
tcpdump
nftables ipset ipvsadm
sctp module

Execute the test
$ sh runtest.sh
